+- true and false applyCmp integer comparisons;
+- empty and nonempty lastAfter recurrences;
+- the defined-domain project:Int case; and
+- proved inequalities against constant definitions for every parameter and an
+  identity implementation of lastAfter.
+
+Command:
+  cd /tmp/audit-work/fresh-proof-2
+  env PATH=/tmp/audit-work/lean-patched-root/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin lake env lean OperationalAudit.lean
+
+Exit code: 0
+
